 ],
 "text": "What if AI took over the world tomorrow? No robots in the streets, just software, quietly doing everything. Here's the timeline. Day 1. Nothing looks different. Then you open your inbox, and it's empty for the first time ever. Every email got answered overnight, including the one to your landlord. Day 2. Every meeting gets a one-line summary. Half of them get canceled. Nobody misses them. Day 3. AI agents start shopping for you. Stores redesign their websites for the agents? Not for you. Your fridge orders milk before you even notice it's gone. Week 2. The AI asks before it spends a cent. Most people tap yes without reading, and somebody's agent buys 40 rubber ducks. Month 1. The people who wrote down how their work gets done are running 10 AI employees. Everyone else is still copying and pasting prompts. Year 1. AI didn't take your job. The person who set it up first did. Want the five skills I set up first? Comment AI, and I'll send them to you free."
}